6088       datalines;

NOTE: The data set WORK.CONTRIVED has 13 observations and 3 variables.

6102       ;
6103       ods graphics on;
6104       proc nlin data=contrived bias hougaard
6105       NLINMEASURES plots(stats=all)=(diagnostics);
6106       parms alpha=2.0
6107       gamma=0.0;
6108       model y = alpha*x1 + exp(gamma*x2);
6109       run;

NOTE: DER.alpha not initialized or missing. It will be computed automatically.
NOTE: DER.gamma not initialized or missing. It will be computed automatically.

